   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "A thin slab of thickness dh holds about \\( 4\\,\\rho(h)\\,dh \\), so the total is \\( 4\\int_{0}^{5} \\left(4 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{h^{2}}{5} \\right)} + 25\\right)\\,dh \\).",
         "rule_named": "accumulation of a density"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "With the calculator in radian mode the integral is about 130.223.",
